     "text": "## Top Destinations by Bookings in 2025\n\n**Phuket** leads with **5,132 bookings**, followed by **Gold Coast** (4,580) and **Mallorca** (4,538) in 2025. \\[[1](https://example.cloud.databricks.com/genie/rooms/01f1cc1054581cf2a16811f9028898a4/chats/01f1cc1212841e70a37d1902c4ea401c?o=0&gra_focus=toolu_bdrk_01mqwscpneauxzw3jsqae475)\\]",
