     "text": "",
     "type": "output_text"
    },
    {
     "annotations": [],
     "text": "### Key Findings\n\nThe top three destinations account for over 14,000 bookings combined. Beach and resort destinations dominate the list, with **Phuket** significantly ahead of other locations. Major cities like **Paris** (3,532), **Tokyo** (2,290), and **New York** (1,863) also feature prominently in the top 10.\n\nAsian destinations show strong performance with Phuket, Gold Coast, Tokyo, Singapore, and Osaka all ranking in the top 10. European beach destinations including Mallorca, Ibiza, and Sardinia also attract significant booking volumes.\n\n*Period: 2025 bookings (data through July 30, 2025)*",
     "type": "output_text"
    }
