     "annotations": [],
     "text": "## Cancellation Rates for Top Destinations in 2025\n\nCancellation rates among the top 20 destinations range from **20.6% to 25.1%**, with most destinations clustering around **21-23%**. \\[[1](https://example.cloud.databricks.com/genie/rooms/01f1cc1054581cf2a16811f9028898a4/chats/01f1cc1212841e70a37d1902c4ea401c?o=0&gra_focus=toolu_bdrk_019mnrm8oa61hu1enwwbxaf7)\\]",
     "type": "output_text"
    },
    {
     "annotations": [],
     "metadata": {
